      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "point-class",
          "nodeId": "point"
        },
        "markdown": "Point captures unresolved issues that block clarity.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `body`, `status`, `owner`, `resolutionPath`, `prominence`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "Point is one idea in the map: a part of the thing, a reason for it, an example, or an objection to it.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `body`, `role`, `check`.\n\nEvery card of the Idea template carries `check`: set it when you are not sure it is right, so the map can show what still needs checking."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
